                <head>No. 11.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram at 10 o’clock p. m., <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-12">February 12,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Al Capitan Craven, aborda la fragata de guerre Niagara,
                        Corunna:</hi></p>
                <p>The ram is fathering her helm-ports, reported to need three days, but keep a
                    sharp look out at night; she is fast. The agent at Ferrol, Antonio J. Fernandez,
                    is trustworthy. No news from the Sacramento.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
